You have an enhanced sense of self preservation, and your keen intuition allows you to sense dangers others miss.

Your ability to detect traps is enhanced ([+17, +24, +28, +32, +35 (TL1-5; CUN 100)] detect 'power').

Critical attacks against you have [3.5%, 6.3%, 8.5%, 10%, 12% (TL1-5)] reduced bonus damage, and damage bonuses attackers gain against you for being unseen are reduced by [15%, 21%, 26%, 29%, 33% (TL1-5)].

You also gain an additional chance (at your normal save [-15, -13, -12, -10, -10 (TL1-5; CUN 100)], effective) to resist detrimental status effects that can be resisted.

The detection and additional save chance improve with Cunning.
